      400.09,
      540.02,
      495.16
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 25A of the Universities Act, No. 16 of 1978, I, Lakshman Kiriella, theMinister of Higher Education and Highways, having obtained a report under Section 70C of the aforesaid Act, in respectof the KAATSU-Highly Advanced Medical Technology Training Centre (Pvt.) Limited (KIU), a company incorporated inSri Lanka under the Companies Act, No. 7 of 2007 and bearing Registration Number PV 66705, do by this Order andsubject to the conditions specified in the Schedule I hereto, recognize the KAATSU-Highly Advanced Medical TechnologyTraining Centre (Pvt) Limited (KIU), as a Degree Awarding Institute for the purpose of developing Higher Educationtherein, leading to the award of the Degrees specified in Column I of the Schedule II hereto, of which the abbreviations areset out in the respective corresponding entries in Column II of the Schedule II hereto.",
